// The solution file `tsc --build` resolves at the workspace root. It compiles nothing itself; it names the
// projects that do, in dependency order.
//
// Only two packages are listed. `packages/config/tsconfig.json` and `packages/ploaness/tsconfig.json` look
// like build inputs and are not: they are the configurations ploaness SHIPS for a consumer to extend, and
// referencing them here would try to compile a consumer's settings as if they described this repository.
// `packages/assets` holds no TypeScript at all.
